<https://opencoesione.gov.it/it/dati/progetti/7ve10041121/> a ns1:Progetto_di_coesione,
        PRJ:PublicInvestmentProject ;
    dcterms:description "The project will tackle the challenge of the increasing demand of diversification of the tourism offer in all seasons and decongesting the main destinations and seaside resorts located in the Adriatic area that are suffering from pressures for an internationalisation of the tourism structures and mass, low-cost tourism. Project partners will contribute to offer a sustainable tourism product and strengthen the area as a high-quality destination.  The main objective is to protect and preserve the historically rooted cuisine and the less known heritage sites and give a boost to the cross-border economy thanks to the KeyQ+ experiential tourism packages. This also valorising some emblematic buildings included in the list of the cultural heritage of the area, such as the historical Market of Pula from the Austro-Hungarian Monarchy, \"the ship of freedom that turned east\" built in 1950, the medieval didactic kitchen in Cividale del Friuli, Casa Artusi, the Wine National Exhibition in Pramaggiore, the Apoxyomenos Museum, together with the Istrian Educational Gastronomy Centre established in t"@it ;
    dcterms:identifier "7VE10041121" ;
    dcterms:subject cup:D89H18000150005 ;
    dcterms:title "KeyQ+: Culture and tourism as keys for quality cross border development of Italy and Croatia"@it ;
    schema:about cup:D89H18000150005 ;
    schema:url <https://opencoesione.gov.it/it/dati/progetti/7ve10041121/> ;
    ns1:codice_locale_progetto "7VE10041121" ;
    ns1:costo_coesione 750079.99 ;
    ns1:ha_ciclo_programmazione <https://w3id.org/italia/draft/OpenCoesione/controlled-vocabulary/ciclo-programmazione/2> ;
    ns1:ha_cup cup:D89H18000150005 ;
